                            <comment id="16655085" author="githubbot" created="Thu, 18 Oct 2018 11:38:30 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user asfgit closed the pull request at:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/4988&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/4988&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16660516" author="nizhikov" created="Tue, 23 Oct 2018 12:00:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hello, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ivandasch&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ivandasch&quot;&gt;ivandasch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=DmitriyGovorukhin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;DmitriyGovorukhin&quot;&gt;DmitriyGovorukhin&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Can you ensure patch is complete?&lt;br/&gt;
From what I see:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
@Override &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; GridMultiCollectionWrapper&amp;lt;FullPageId&amp;gt; beginCheckpoint() &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;throws&lt;/span&gt; IgniteException {
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;//...
&lt;/span&gt;    collections[i] = seg.segCheckpointPages = seg.dirtyPages;

    seg.dirtyPages = &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; GridConcurrentHashSet&amp;lt;&amp;gt;();
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;//...
&lt;/span&gt;}
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And your code:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;private&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;long&lt;/span&gt; refreshOutdatedPage(Segment seg, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; grpId, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;long&lt;/span&gt; pageId, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;boolean&lt;/span&gt; rmv) {
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;//...
&lt;/span&gt;        Collection&amp;lt;FullPageId&amp;gt; cpPages = seg.segCheckpointPages;

        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (cpPages != &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;)
            cpPages.remove(&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; FullPageId(pageId, grpId));

        Collection&amp;lt;FullPageId&amp;gt; dirtyPages = seg.dirtyPages;

        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (dirtyPages != &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;)
            dirtyPages.remove(&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; FullPageId(pageId, grpId));
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;//...
&lt;/span&gt;    }
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As far as I can understand there is a specific execution path when we don&apos;t see `segCheckpointPages` nor `dirtyPages`&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;T1 - Collection&amp;lt;FullPageId&amp;gt; cpPages = seg.segCheckpointPages;
T2 - seg.segCheckpointPages = seg.dirtyPages;
T2 - seg.dirtyPages = new GridConcurrentHashSet&amp;lt;&amp;gt;();
T1 - dirtyPages.remove(new FullPageId(pageId, grpId));
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16660785" author="ivandasch" created="Tue, 23 Oct 2018 15:02:20 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=NIzhikov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;nizhikov&quot;&gt;NIzhikov&lt;/a&gt; Nikolay, beginCheckpoint is called under checkpointLock.writeLock (see Checkpointer#markCheckpointBegin). But all operations in PageMemoryImpl, where refreshOutdatedPage called, is run under checkpointReadLock(). So the case mentioned by you above is not possible.&lt;br/&gt;
However, finishCheckpoint is not called under that lock (see Checkpointer#markCheckpointEnd) so NPE is possible. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16660903" author="nizhikov" created="Tue, 23 Oct 2018 16:13:25 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ivandasch&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ivandasch&quot;&gt;ivandasch&lt;/a&gt;&#160; Thanks for the explanation.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16661371" author="dmitriygovorukhin" created="Tue, 23 Oct 2018 22:11:58 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=NIzhikov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;nizhikov&quot;&gt;NIzhikov&lt;/a&gt; What about including this fix in ignite-2.7?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16739533" author="dmitriygovorukhin" created="Thu, 10 Jan 2019 15:45:13 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged to mater. &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ivandasch&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ivandasch&quot;&gt;ivandasch&lt;/a&gt; Thanks for the contribution!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
